  '23#_': `Some say law like veset she will see, etc. Above siman 187 seif 10 clear Mechaber if saw twice night after immersion concerned like unfixed uprooted once since not established thrice — if established thrice established veset — immersion say causes sight no equal days say night composite veset — Tosafot distinguished jumps from eating hot foods no exertion — immersion cold winter water more exertion than jump dance; Razah critique distinguished voluntary desire acts unlike jumps — Mechaber agreed Razah; here seif 3 if established hour veset i.e. saw ascending immersion Raavad learns uprooted one hour even without examination — unfixed as jumps; appears this Raavad — Raavad eating garlic like jump veset; Mechaber words appear contradictory sometimes Raavad sometimes Razah; learned if ate heating food today tomorrow saw thrice — veset concerned day two after eating heating not day one as immersion causes second night concerned relations first night permitted — here likewise; perhaps Mechaber holds immersion like jump not establishes — when sees without relations; but sees from relations since relations liable blood as many places addition — with relations jump etc. concerned composite veset days jumps veset; also since relations alone established veset seeing — combined jump immersion veset; unlike saw ascending immersion only immersion before relations — jump veset unfixed uprooted hour — proven Mechaber first view eating heating like jump or also exertion — requires study; doubt jump veset not established alone only with body veset — jumped began yawning sneezed saw blood thrice — R. Papa jumped alone not saw or yawned alone — if days jumps combine has jump veset known time; Gemara not established jump alone only with days — one of them — likewise combination body veset — as said perhaps combines relations slight proof — said combination requires study; also divide many — requires study.`,
